# Everything in this project is tracked deliberately -- caches, generated
# outputs, run logs, data dumps and all. The only exclusions are the two
# things that cannot or must not go into git:

# Virtualenv: macOS-arm64 binaries, rebuildable with `pip install -r
# requirements.txt`, and contains individual files over GitHub's 100MB
# hard limit. Rebuild it on the new machine rather than carrying it.
.venv/
.venv.broken-stale-path.bak/

# Live API keys. Regenerate these from the provider console on the new
# machine; never in git history, where they are permanent.
.env
